  "description": "Engaged Orange Squeezer feedback compressor, based on the General Guitar Gadgets original-reference redraw dated 2012-01-12. Bias sets the JFET operating point. Q2 is a selected 2N5457 with -0.93 V cutoff. The 1N34A and 1N4007 model cards represent the 1N100 detector and 1N4001 supply protection diodes. Source: https://generalguitargadgets.com/pdf/ggg_osq_sc_original.pdf",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Volume",
      "Bias"
    ]
  },
  "name": "Dan Armstrong Orange Squeezer",
